[622803] = {622803, 1000, "\u{3000}\u{3000}You\u{0020}managed\u{0020}to\u{0020}stop\u{0020}Mirai's\u{0020}rampage\u{0020}just\u{0020}in\u{0020}time,\u{0020}and\u{0020}the\u{0020}price\u{0020}you\u{0020}paid\u{0020}was\u{0020}this:\u{0020}she\u{0020}is\u{0020}now\u{0020}sitting\u{0020}snugly\u{0020}in\u{0020}your\u{0020}arms,\u{0020}happily\u{0020}doing\u{0020}her\u{0020}homework.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}Although\u{0020}she\u{0020}is\u{0020}already\u{0020}a\u{0020}Driver,\u{0020}considering\u{0020}Mirai's\u{0020}young\u{0020}age,\u{0020}Aegis\u{0020}has\u{0020}arranged\u{0020}developmental\u{0020}courses\u{0020}for\u{0020}her\u{0020}in\u{0020}areas\u{0020}such\u{0020}as\u{0020}language,\u{0020}reasoning,\u{0020}and\u{0020}memory…\u{0020}Detective\u{0020}games\u{0020}are\u{0020}also\u{0020}part\u{0020}of\u{0020}the\u{0020}curriculum,\u{0020}meant\u{0020}to\u{0020}train\u{0020}children's\u{0020}practical\u{0020}skills\u{0020}and\u{0020}logical\u{0020}thinking.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"But\u{0020}I\u{0020}don't\u{0020}recall\u{0020}these\u{0020}trainings\u{0020}being\u{0020}meant\u{0020}to\u{0020}sharpen\u{0020}a\u{0020}kid's\u{0020}sense\u{0020}of\u{0020}smell,\"\u{0020}you\u{0020}think\u{0020}to\u{0020}yourself\u{0020}as\u{0020}you\u{0020}sniff\u{0020}at\u{0020}your\u{0020}own\u{0020}clothes,\u{0020}trying\u{0020}to\u{0020}confirm\u{0020}what\u{0020}this\u{0020}so-called\u{0020}\"cheating\u{0020}scent\"\u{0020}actually\u{0020}is.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}The\u{0020}result\u{0020}is\u{0020}obvious,\u{0020}there's\u{0020}nothing\u{0020}strange\u{0020}at\u{0020}all...\u{0020}If\u{0020}anything,\u{0020}there's\u{0020}only\u{0020}the\u{0020}faint,\u{0020}fresh\u{0020}scent\u{0020}of\u{0020}Mirai's\u{0020}laundry\u{0020}detergent…\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"Ah...\"\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"What\u{0020}is\u{0020}it...\u{0020}Mr.\u{0020}Pervert?\u{0020}Have\u{0020}you\u{0020}finally\u{0020}decided\u{0020}to\u{0020}confess\u{0020}to\u{0020}me?\"\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"Mirai…\u{0020}did\u{0020}you\u{0020}recently\u{0020}change\u{0020}your\u{0020}laundry\u{0020}detergent…?\"\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"You're\u{0020}way\u{0020}too\u{0020}slow,\u{0020}Mr.\u{0020}Pervert!\u{0020}I\u{0020}already\u{0020}changed\u{0020}it\u{0020}yesterday!\"\u{0020}Mirai\u{0020}complains\u{0020}unhappily.\u{0020}\"This\u{0020}is\u{0020}the\u{0020}latest\u{0020}model\u{0020}that's\u{0020}said\u{0020}to\u{0020}be\u{0020}the\u{0020}most\u{0020}effective.\u{0020}[Enchanting\u{0020}Witch]…\u{0020}ah…\"\n\u{3000}\u{3000}She\u{0020}seems\u{0020}to\u{0020}have\u{0020}realized\u{0020}something.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"Could\u{0020}it\u{0020}be…\u{0020}the\u{0020}scent\u{0020}on\u{0020}Mr.\u{0020}Pervert\u{0020}is\u{0020}actually\u{0020}the\u{0020}scent\u{0020}of\u{0020}[Enchanting\u{0020}Witch]…?\"\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"That's\u{0020}right…\u{0020}I've\u{0020}just\u{0020}confirmed\u{0020}it…\u{0020}it's\u{0020}exactly\u{0020}the\u{0020}same\u{0020}as\u{0020}the\u{0020}fragrance\u{0020}on\u{0020}you\u{0020}right\u{0020}now…\u{0020}Looks\u{0020}like\u{0020}your\u{0020}detective\u{0020}training\u{0020}still\u{0020}has\u{0020}a\u{0020}long\u{0020}way\u{0020}to\u{0020}go!\"\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"I\u{0020}don't\u{0020}believe\u{0020}it!?\u{0020}Let\u{0020}me\u{0020}smell\u{0020}Mr.\u{0020}Pervert's\u{0020}crotch!?\"\u{0020}Saying\u{0020}this,\u{0020}Mirai\u{0020}dove\u{0020}under\u{0020}the\u{0020}desk\u{0020}at\u{0020}lightning\u{0020}speed.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"Your\u{0020}lady\u{0020}training\u{0020}also\u{0020}still\u{0020}has\u{0020}a\u{0020}long\u{0020}way\u{0020}to\u{0020}go!!!\"\u{0020}You\u{0020}firmly\u{0020}held\u{0020}Mirai's\u{0020}head\u{0020}down,\u{0020}not\u{0020}letting\u{0020}her\u{0020}crawl\u{0020}out\u{0020}from\u{0020}under\u{0020}the\u{0020}desk.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"N-Nav-Navigator…\u{0020}what\u{0020}are\u{0020}you\u{0020}doing\u{0020}to\u{0020}Mirai!?\"\u{0020}Appearing\u{0020}alongside\u{0020}that\u{0020}line\u{0020}was...\u{0020}Franca.\n\u{3000}\u{3000}\"Huh!?\u{0020}The\u{0020}Navigator\u{0020}is\u{0020}a\